      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=18>- 1-Drum Scatter Symbols can appear on all reels.\n- 3 or more
      consecutive 1-Drum Scatter Symbols from the leftmost reel\n    triggers Free
      Games.\n\n- 3-Drum Scatter Symbols can appear on reels 1-3 only.\n- 3 or more
      consecutive 3-Drum Scatter Symbols with at least one\n    1-Drum Scatter Symbol
      from the leftmost reel triggers Boost Free\n    Games. \n\n- Wild can substitute
      for any Scatter Symbols on reels 2-5."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '<size=22>- Wild Symbol appears on reels 2-5 only.

      - Wild Symbol can substitute for all symbols.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_11
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT PICK BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=22>- Every time Wild Symbol appears, it is collected at \n    Gold
      Pot and Jackpot Pick Bonus Game may be\n    triggered with certain probability.\r\n-
      Jackpot Pick Bonus Game is a 3-matching Pick Game. \r\n- 3 identical Jackpot
      Coins awards the jackpot and \n    Jackpot Pick Bonus Game ends. \r\n- Once
      a jackpot is won, 1 more Pick Bonus Game may \n    be awarded randomly.\r\n-
      1 More Pick Bonus Game continues until another \n    jackpot is awarded with
      3 identical of another\n    Jackpot Coins.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_13
    value: <style=title><size=32>Multiplier Wild</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_13
    value: <size=22>- Wild may appear as a Multiplier Wild on reel 3.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: "<size=22>- A multiplier of Total Bet is awarded as Bonus Pay. \n- Winning
      a Bonus symbol way win awards a bonus with different Free Games options."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=27>FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: "<size=20>- Free Games is triggered with 3 or more consecutive 1-Drum\n
      \  Scatter Symbols.\n- Before entering Free Games, player selects one of the
      5\n    options below Free Game.\n     - 15 Free Games, 243 Ways\n     - 10 Free
      Games, 1024 Ways\n     - 5 Free Games, 3125 Ways\n     - 3 Free Games, 7776
      Ways\n     - Mystery Pick"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=27>EXPANDING FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=20>- In Base Game and Boost Free Game, the reels may expand by\n
      \  1 row, consecutively, up to 4 times, to a max reel set of 7x5.\r\n- Expanding
      Feature ends when the reel set no longer expands.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=27>BOOST FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=20>- Boost Free Games is triggered with 3 or more 3-Drum \n    Scatter
      Symbols including at least one 1-Drum Scatter \n    Symbol.\r\n- Before entering
      Boost Free Games, player selects one of\n    the 5 options below Free Game.\r\n
      \    - 15 Free Games, 243 to 16,807 Ways\r\n     - 10 Free Games, 1024 to 32,768
      Ways\r\n     - 5 Free Games, 3125 to 59,049 Ways\r\n     - 3 Free Games, 7776
      to 100,000 Ways\r\n     - Mystery Pick\r\n- In Boost Free Games, Expanding Feature
      can be triggered."
